{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794367592977,"sessionID":"ses_e3785b9d6ffexswiiPajgXY1XI","part":{"id":"prt_1c8a499f1001ynWxA2rlV9bBb8","messageID":"msg_1c8a3e43a001DDKB8qKaBKUalI","sessionID":"ses_e3785b9d6ffexswiiPajgXY1XI","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794367592977,"sessionID":"ses_e3785b9d6ffexswiiPajgXY1XI","part":{"id":"prt_1c8a499f7001iNJL4812c0fBAZ","messageID":"msg_1c8a3e43a001DDKB8qKaBKUalI","sessionID":"ses_e3785b9d6ffexswiiPajgXY1XI","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a multi-author blog: Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth, posts CRUD, admin take-down) + React/TypeScript/Vite frontend with Tailwind, served by the backend on port 8000, SQLite data under `./data`, built from the root `Dockerfile`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Spec highlights: register → 201; login → 200 exactly `{\"token\": \"<token>\"}`; auth via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; 401 without valid token; list response exactly `{\"items\",\"total\",\"page\",\"page_size\"}` newest first; post object exactly 8 fields (`id,title,content,tags,created_at,updated_at,author,excerpt`) — `taken_down` added only for admin requests/list items with `include_taken_down=1`; `author` is username string; excerpt = line-break runs collapsed to single space, then truncated to 200 chars; `updated_at` changes on every update (bumped +1µs if not strictly greater); PUT replaces post, omitted `tags` cleared; taken-down post excluded from list for everyone (literal spec reading), GET by id → 404 for everyone but admin; admin = username `admin`, password from env `ADMIN_PASSWORD` read at startup, sign-in disabled when unset/empty; registering any \"admin\" case-variant → 409.\n- Error bodies use both keys: `{\"error\": msg, \"message\": msg}`; status choices: 400 validation, 409 duplicate username, 401 login/auth, 403 non-author/non-admin, 404 missing/hidden; DELETE → 200 `{\"ok\": true}`.\n- List params: `q` (case-insensitive LIKE on title/content, escaped), `tag` (exact via `post_tags` table), `author` (exact username), `page` (default 1), `page_size` (default 10, clamped 1–100), `include_taken_down=1` honored only for admin.\n- Validation: title required non-empty, content required as string, tags must be list of strings (normalized: strip, drop empty, dedupe).\n- `backend/requirements.lock` rewritten as plain version pins WITHOUT hashes — hashes in a constraints file activate pip's require-hashes mode and break the Docker build (verified with pip 25.1.1).\n- Frontend: hash-based routing (`#/`, `#/post/:id`, `#/write`, `#/edit/:id`, `#/login`, `#/register`), session in `localStorage` keys `blog.token`/`blog.username`, admin detected client-side by username `admin`; Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin; live filter inputs debounce 300ms with `pendingChange` guard (avoids clobbering page clicks); list filters lifted into App state; delete uses `window.confirm`.\n- Environment: Python 3.13.5, Node 24, npm 11; no docker; local venv at `/workspace/.venv`; server run via `gunicorn --bind 127.0.0.1:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app` from `/workspace`.\n- Shell gotcha: never chain `pkill -f '[g]unicorn'` with commands containing the literal string \"gunicorn\" — pkill matches the shell's own cmdline and kills it (caused earlier timeouts). Run pkill alone.\n- External dir `/tmp/opencode/*` denied; temp files go in `/workspace/.tmp/`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Backend implemented and smoke-tested: all checks in `/workspace/.tmp/smoke.py` pass (\"ALL PASSED\") on fresh DB — register/login/duplicate/admin-block, post CRUD, validation, excerpt, paging, q/tag/author filters, ownership 403, auth 401, admin toggle/restore, taken-down visibility rules, JSON 404 for unknown `/api` routes.\n- Verified `ADMIN_PASSWORD` unset → admin login 401 \"Admin sign-in is disabled\"; data persists across restarts (`alice` login + posts still present).\n- Frontend fully written (api.ts, router.ts, format.ts, App.tsx, Header/PostList/PostPage/Editor/AuthForm), `tsc --noEmit` passes, `npm run build` succeeds (dist/index.html + assets, Tailwind CSS ~15.9KB with utilities verified present).\n- `frontend/package.json` updated with exact pins: `tailwindcss` 4.3.5, `@tailwindcss/vite` 4.3.5, `@types/react` 19.3.0, `@types/react-dom` 19.3.0; `package-lock.json` updated.\n- Served frontend verified via curl: `/` returns index.html (title \"Blog\"), assets 200, SPA route falls back to index.html, `/api/unknown` returns JSON 404.\n- `frontend/vite.config.ts` has tailwind plugin; `src/index.css` = `@import \"tailwindcss\";`; `tsconfig.json` added.\n\n### Active\n- Server currently running WITHOUT `ADMIN_PASSWORD` (fresh smoke data from latest run in `/workspace/data/blog.db`); last verified admin-disabled + persistence behavior.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run a final full API pass with `ADMIN_PASSWORD` set (restart server alone, then run `/workspace/.tmp/smoke.py`) to confirm nothing regressed after frontend-only changes.\n2. Final cleanup/review: remove `/workspace/.tmp`, `/workspace/.venv`, `/workspace/.venv`-created `__pycache__`, and test data in `/workspace/data` (keep `data/` dir creation to runtime), verify `git status` shows only intended changes, re-run `npm run build` and confirm spec compliance end-to-end.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: Flask entry — error handlers (JSON 404/405 for `/api/`), health, SPA serving with `api/` guard, `db.init_db()` + `auth.bootstrap_admin()` at import.\n- `/workspace/backend/db.py`: SQLite helpers (`get_conn`, `DATA_DIR=Path(\"data\")`, `DB_FILE=data/blog.db`), schema (users/tokens/posts/tags).\n- `/workspace/backend/auth.py`: register/login routes, token issuance, `require_auth`/`require_admin`, `bootstrap_admin`, `admin_password()`.\n- `/workspace/backend/posts.py`: list/create/get/update/delete/toggle routes, `excerpt()`, `validate_body()`, `serialize(with_status=...)`.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: rewritten as plain pins (no hashes) — do not reintroduce hashes.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: unchanged; runs `npm ci` then `npm run build`, pip install with `-c backend/requirements.lock`, gunicorn `app:app` on 8000.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/`: `api.ts` (fetch client + session), `router.ts`, `format.ts`, `App.tsx` (routing + lifted `ListFilters`), `components/{Header,PostList,PostPage,Editor,AuthForm}.tsx`.\n- `/workspace/.tmp/smoke.py`: backend API smoke test (expects `ADMIN_PASSWORD=secret123` login).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`: deps and typecheck config.","time":{"start":1794367592951,"end":1794367592954}}}
